WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
1. Open Find, then choose Replace in Files.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
2. Find the old name: Trail Notes.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.000
3. Enter the new name: Weekend Notes.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
4. Click Replace... to review the changes.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
5. Keep checked only the changes you want.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
6. Click Replace in the review to apply them.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.500
7. Choose File > Save All.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:28.000
8. Search the old name again. No results means it is gone.

